  documents:
  - 'CATALOG SAMPLE - not the full archive

    Contents / Legislation


    Catalog
    record for the SimDemocracy Constitution. Read the linked

    source for the
    constitutional text. This prototype does not

    reproduce the document or determine
    whether a provision remains in

    force.


    Revision: 6782

    Source updated:
    2026-09-14T18:17:53Z

    Imported: 2026-09-18

    Source:

    https://archive.simdemocracy.org/index.php?title=Constitution&oldi

    d=6782

'
  - 'CATALOG SAMPLE - not the full archive

    Orientation


    The Secretary Name
    National Archives documents SimDemocracy, an

    online democratic community
    founded in 2019. The collection

    emphasizes laws and links to legislation,
    executive orders, case

    law, historical material and newcomer guidance. This
    is an

    original orientation summary, not a reproduction of the archive

    page.


    Revision:
    1478

    Source updated: 2026-05-10T23:29:38Z

    Imported: 2026-09-18

    Source:

    https://archive.simdemocracy.org/index.php?title=Main+Page&oldid=1

    478

'
  - 'CATALOG SAMPLE - not the full archive

    Contents


    Catalog record for
    the archive''s New User Guide. The source is

    intended as an introduction
    for newcomers. This prototype includes

    the source and revision metadata;
    the full guide is not included.


    Revision: 5949

    Source updated: 2026-07-29T16:05:11Z

    Imported:
    2026-09-18

    Source:

    https://archive.simdemocracy.org/index.php?title=New+User+Guide&ol

    did=5949

'
